  "sourceTitle": "Corn Flake Topped Potato Casserole",
  "sourceText": "Corn Flake Topped Potato Casserole\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Sunday, December 13, 2009 - 11:23pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 pound thawed hash browns\n1 can cream of chicken soup\n1/2 pt. sour cream\n1/4 cup chopped onion\n1/2 teaspoon pepper\n5 ounces shredded Cheddar cheese\n1/4 cup melted butter\n2 cups mashed corn flakes\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix soup and sour cream together. Put hash browns in bowl and add soup mixture. Mix well. Pour into 9x11 dish. Sprinkle topping over top. Bake at 350 degrees for 45 minutes or until bubbly.",
